Package: HalfSibMapStudio
Type: Project
Title: Graphical Workbench for Maternal Linkage Mapping with HalfSibMap
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marcelo", "Mollinari", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A local Shiny application that drives the HalfSibMap R package
    through a staged, reproducible maternal linkage-mapping workflow for one
    open-pollinated (half-sib) family at a time.
